" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12 content-head mb-5\">\n\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style  mb-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<b>Serviços&nbsp;</b></h1>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-4 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n\t\t\t\t\tCertificação de Sistemas de Gestão</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-4 item-mb active\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-left item-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3 mbr-number\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-number\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>01.</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\"><b>Certificação Setor Público e Previdência </b><br><b>(Pro Gestão)</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\"><br>Certificação do Manual PRO-GESTÃO RPPS (UN PGE - Acreditação Cgcre/INMETRO e Ministério do Trabalho)  <br><br>Duo Diligence PRO-GESTÃO (UN DUO)<br><br>Treinamento PRO-GESTÃO (UN TPG)&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-4 item-mb\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\" align-left item-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3 mbr-number\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-number\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>02.</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\"><b>Treinamento Corporativo (UN OTA)&nbsp;</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\">SASC - Sistema de Armazenamento Subterrâneo de Combustíveis (OCP N.º 0137 - Portaria nº 009/2011)  <br><br>Ensaio de Estanqueidade em Instalações Subterrâneas (OCP N.º 0137 - Portaria nº 259/2008)  <br>Qualihab - CDHU / Sinaenco (HAB)</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-4 item-mb\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-left item-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3 mbr-number\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-number\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>03.</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\"><b>Customizados</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\">A ICV BRASIL desenvolveu soluções em treinamentos elaborados para atender às necessidades das Organizações e do mercado, utilizando estratégia de aprendizado corporativo e metodologia própria, acreditada pelo PROCERT, oferecendo conteúdos prontos ou customizados que podem ser aplicados de maneira online ou presencial.<br><br><b><a href=\"mailto:especialista@icvbrasil.com?subject=Lead%20%20Site%20Servi%C3%A7os%20customizados\" class=\"text-primary\">Fale com o nosso especialista</a></b></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "features036-e",
          "_cid": "vuDy2CWswG",
